 r←ChangeLog(space folder args);msg;name;⎕TRAP
⍝ Desc: Takes an APL name and lists all commits the object was part of
⍝ Parse: 1 -project=
⍝ Project: 0
 name←args._1
 :If ~(⊃name)∊'#⎕'
     name←(⍕space),'.',name
 :EndIf
 ('Not an APL object: ',name)Assert 0<⎕NC name
 r←folder ##.ChangeLog name
⍝Done
